WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.420
<i>Huh? What do we think about Wiseman lately?</i>

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:07.130
<i>Hmm, they haven't really been bothering us.</i>

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:09.900
<i>They never change it up. It's getting
 a little old, honestly.</i>

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:13.400
<i>The five-stars they call are strong,</i>

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.090
<i>but they really don't know how to use them.</i>

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:18.660
<i>Honestly, the five-stars are 
kind of wasted on them.</i>

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:22.830
That's the general public's opinion of you.

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:24.860
"The general public"?

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:26.670
That was obviously Haruharu and his buddies!

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:29.120
That doesn't matter.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:30.880
Look at this.

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:37.080
This is your win-loss record
 with Branch Office #8.

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:39.400
At first, you were pretty even,

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:42.310
but lately, you keep getting your butt kicked!

00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:44.520
How does it make you feel, seeing this?

00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:47.350
They've gotten stronger, guru.

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:49.360
They've really grown up.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:51.610
Well, they still have some 
more growing up to do.

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:53.580
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:56.260
So you're not interested in improving, huh?

00:00:56.830 --> 00:00:58.320
All right.

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.240
I'm ending my employment 
contract with you in a month.

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:05.900
Wait, wait! Hang on, wait!

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:10.620
Ending our contract?
Does that mean we're fired?

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:12.240
Of course.

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:15.320
You're not doing a good job,
and you're not willing to fix things.

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:17.150
No!

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:43.910
<b>~ the journey to the end of the despair ~</b>

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:51.650
<b>Episode 9: Expanding Galaxy</b>

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:50.390
No way!

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:53.380
A fancy dorm with eight bedrooms!

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:57.010
All the manga we can read, 
and the latest video games,

00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:58.690
as well as free soft drinks!

00:02:58.690 --> 00:03:00.570
Hot springs, massage chairs,

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:01.950
and ping pong and karaoke,

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:03.910
even bowling, all for free!

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:06.200
Once we've experienced heaven like this,

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:09.230
we can't go back to being poor, guru!

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:10.240
Yeah, yeah, yeah!

00:03:10.240 --> 00:03:12.740
I-chan says she has manga series 
she hasn't finished yet,

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:14.130
so she doesn't want to quit.

00:03:15.640 --> 00:03:18.360
Maybe the job benefits 
were a little too good, huh?

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:20.520
You can't just fire us all of a sudden, guru!

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:22.400
It's power harassment, guru!
It's not fair, guru!

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:25.860
I told you, you've got a month.

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:29.810
Until then, you're going to 
work for the new supervisor I hired.

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:32.440
A new supervisor?

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:34.310
Who? Who?

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:36.820
Sonya, come in.

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:51.620
I'll introduce you.

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:56.040
This is the new supervisor
I hired, Android Sonya.

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:58.940
Android?

00:03:58.940 --> 00:03:59.510
Yeah?

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:04.060
Sonya is the perfect android employee!

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:07.730
The online reviews of her were really good!

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:10.190
"Product came quick! Thx!"

00:04:10.190 --> 00:04:13.620
"Will surely use your compny agen."

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:15.710
"Very very good product! Will be quality."

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:16.880
"Safe trading!"

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:17.410
"Good price!"

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:18.160
"No problm!!!"

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:19.150
"No problm!!!"

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:21.220
And she wasn't that expensive, either.

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:24.030
If there's that many 
good reviews, she must be safe.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:26.180
No, I don't think...

00:04:26.180 --> 00:04:28.850
It's really not a good idea to trust those.

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:33.610
So you're the ones who'll be working for me?

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:36.560
You all look incompetent.

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:38.220
Sh-She talked!

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:39.800
And she's already really mean.

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:45.220
For the next month, I'm going to work you like
 dogs to help Blackpanella-sama. Be ready.

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:47.790
Glad to hear it.

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:53.080
Luluna, from now on you'll do your 
calls when Sonya tells you to.

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:54.730
I'm counting on you, call girl.

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:08.200
I never thought we'd have an android boss.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:09.720
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:14.280
"You used to see stories about androids 
taking over all the time in old sci-fi,

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:17.760
but I never thought it would 
happen to us," she says.

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:20.960
No, that was way longer than
 what she said, guru.

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:23.740
But what do we do now?

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:27.480
We can't slack off like we have been.

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:31.680
We could just quit now, but...

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:35.720
I like this lifestyle too much, guru!

00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:39.320
I don't want to go back to eating weeds 
and sleeping under bridges, guru!

00:05:39.320 --> 00:05:42.880
But either way, we're getting
 fired in a month.

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:47.320
We need to come up with some way to 
get rid of Sonya and keep our jobs.

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:52.870
Wait, is that android even all that strong?

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:54.280
That's right!

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:57.960
Haruharu and his buddies 
might just kick her butt!

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:01.420
Please, don't hurt me!

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:07.140
That has to be it, guru!

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:10.030
With boobs that big, there's no
 way she can be that strong, guru.

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:11.220
Yeah, yeah.

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:15.040
Haru and his friends are 
strong now. They won't lose easily.

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:16.660
I know they'll win.

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:22.150
And so, now it's time for you to 
fight our new boss, Sonya-san,

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:25.950
for the rights to this spiral job, guru!

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:29.650
She's just another one 
of your buddies, right?

00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:33.780
I'll show you that just because your boobs 
are bigger doesn't mean you're stronger!

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:36.620
A meaningless rivalry.

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:41.990
By the way, Sonya-san's really strong, 
so we won't use Lulululu's calls.

00:06:41.990 --> 00:06:44.210
That was the plan.

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:52.430
But let's see if this goes 
the way you think it will.

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:14.890
That was a new record for losing.

00:07:15.650 --> 00:07:17.740
That was kinda cool, maybe, guru!

00:07:18.560 --> 00:07:21.830
<i>After that, we kept winning.</i>

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:51.450
<i>Of course, it was only 
because Sonya was so strong.</i>

00:07:57.820 --> 00:08:00.120
That was so amazing, oink.

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:04.960
Haru's gang is no match 
for you, Sonya-sama, oink!

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:06.300
Of course not.

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:08.420
When I get back, I'll whip you.

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:10.380
Oink!

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:17.600
<i>Guru learned of the joys of masochism 
and adapted to his environment.</i>

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:18.930
<i>And there was one more...</i>

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:21.720
Sonya-san, I finished 
polishing your boots, oink!

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:24.000
They're as good as new, oink!

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:26.720
I'll slap you later, then.

00:08:26.720 --> 00:08:28.000
Oink!

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:31.860
<i>Gajeru comes from time 
to time and oinks a lot.</i>

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:35.790
Jeez. You're our enemy! 
What are you doing here, oink?

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:38.600
Get off our carriage!
 You're bothering us, oink!

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:39.910
Shut up, oink!

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:44.100
Butt out of my wonderful master-slave 
relationship with Sonya-san, oink oink!

00:08:46.270 --> 00:08:48.000
Sonya's dangerous?

00:08:48.220 --> 00:08:51.660
You should return her, now.

00:08:52.450 --> 00:08:53.340
I see.

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:56.770
It's true that she's going a little too far,

00:08:56.770 --> 00:08:58.930
but she's the ideal android employee.

00:08:59.340 --> 00:09:01.210
There's nothing to worry about.

00:09:01.210 --> 00:09:02.390
But...

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:06.770
Wiseman can't handle this 
project on their own anymore.

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:09.750
It will all be resolved soon,

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:15.360
including the mystery of the too-powerful 
calls that's bothering you, perhaps.

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:35.050
<b>~ the journey to the end of the despair ~</b>

00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:42.060
We only get to stay another week, huh?

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:48.340
Well, if we think of it as 
being rid of Sonya soon,

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:49.830
it's not so bad.

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:54.610
But this place was so comfy.

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:55.990
Not just this dorm,

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:58.580
but Blackblack and Lulululu, too.

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:00.160
And Haruharu and his friends, too.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:10.420
You got 'em, oink!

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:12.940
Another win for you, Sonya-sama, oink!

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:18.720
Now we little piggies get to fight 
the spirals in this village, oink!

00:10:19.240 --> 00:10:22.010
They never win, and they never learn.

00:10:23.840 --> 00:10:25.190
Haru, are you okay?

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:27.850
You got blown away again today.

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:29.760
I'm so jealous!

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:33.790
Sonya-san, hit me like that, oink!

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:34.400
No.

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:36.520
I'm going home.

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:39.780
You guys handle the spirals 
and finish things up here.

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:40.820
'Kay!

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:43.710
I'll go with you, oink!

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:48.840
Just give it up, Haru.

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:51.700
Sonya-san's an android.

00:10:51.700 --> 00:10:54.540
People like us can't hope to beat her.

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:56.080
That's right.

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:59.880
We could try to fight her 
with calls, but Iona's useless.

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:04.200
Haruharu, at this rate, you really will die!

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:06.770
She doesn't hold back.

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:08.160
I know.

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:11.350
But that doesn't mean I can give up.

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:17.320
Haru, how can you keep fighting 
without running away?

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:23.180
When we saw how much stronger 
she was, we had to give up.

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:25.280
But you're different.

00:11:25.760 --> 00:11:27.550
Why can you hang in there?

00:11:29.960 --> 00:11:33.750
Because I can't do anything else.

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:42.300
I promised someone that I'd get 
stronger and become a powerful period.

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:45.730
But I'm no good at fighting,

00:11:45.730 --> 00:11:47.490
and I'm so tiny, too.

00:11:47.490 --> 00:11:51.250
That's why all I can do is not give up.

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:52.390
That's all.

00:11:53.240 --> 00:11:54.220
Haru...

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:57.820
You're not going to follow my orders?

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:03.280
Yes. Why do I have to hold back 
against such weak periods?

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:06.240
Wouldn't it be better just to crush them?

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:09.190
I know what I'm doing.

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:12.820
If you're the ideal android employee,

00:12:12.820 --> 00:12:13.830
then do what you're told.

00:12:14.990 --> 00:12:16.520
No.

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:19.420
I'm not going to hold back 
against someone weak.

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:24.480
It seems Luluna was right.

00:12:24.480 --> 00:12:27.000
You're not an ideal employee at all.

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:28.930
You're simply defective.

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:30.540
I'll contact your creators immediately.

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:34.600
I'm afraid my warranty's just run out.

00:12:35.860 --> 00:12:40.300
Now I can finally take over...

00:12:40.300 --> 00:12:42.400
No way... a Sonya timer?

00:12:43.440 --> 00:12:45.110
Who knows?

00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:50.220
From now on, this organization belongs to me!

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:56.120
Luluna, run!

00:12:58.810 --> 00:12:59.900
Don't hurt her!

00:12:59.900 --> 00:13:01.660
I won't.

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:04.310
She's worth using.

00:13:04.310 --> 00:13:08.590
Work hard for us androids, okay?

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:24.000
It is now time for Commander Sonya
 to give her speech, oink!

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:26.210
When did this happen?

00:13:26.210 --> 00:13:28.250
Don't ask me.

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:31.160
Why is Guru her Number Two?

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:33.480
Listen up, incompetents!

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:36.140
I have only one desire:

00:13:36.140 --> 00:13:38.960
the complete conquest of the Six Powers!

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:40.850
Complete conquest?

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:44.110
Wh-What a plot twist!

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:46.360
That's impossible.

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:47.180
Yeah, yeah.

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:49.810
It's not, though.

00:13:49.810 --> 00:13:55.420
I, Android Sonya, am a
 worldwide best seller.

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:59.120
All my sisters scattered all over the world

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:03.760
are trusted by people as ideal employees.

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:05.840
Unlike me.

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:12.130
If they all started listening to me at once,

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:13.850
what would happen?

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:16.450
That would cause chaos!

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:17.890
Yes.

00:14:17.890 --> 00:14:20.400
Conquest is easy.

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:27.260
Even the military oligarchy of the Spar Realm
 can't fight a rebellion from within!

00:14:27.710 --> 00:14:29.180
Who's controlling you?

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:31.460
Nobody.

00:14:31.460 --> 00:14:33.860
I'm just a defective product.

00:14:33.860 --> 00:14:35.970
You could say that this wisdom...

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:40.850
...was divine insight granted 
to me by the galaxy!

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:43.400
Oink!

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:47.340
Stop me if you can.

00:14:47.340 --> 00:14:52.200
The world will soon belong to us androids!

00:14:54.340 --> 00:14:55.990
She's crazy.

00:14:55.990 --> 00:14:57.950
Well, she is defective.

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:00.920
Everyone, I need your help.

00:15:04.280 --> 00:15:07.760
What is Blackblack thinking,

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:09.920
asking for help from Haruharu?

00:15:09.920 --> 00:15:11.560
Yeah, yeah, yeah!

00:15:11.560 --> 00:15:15.760
I mean sure, we don't have 
anybody else we can ask, but...

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:19.310
Even if they do come, they can't stop her!

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:23.440
But that doesn't mean I can give up.

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:28.790
Um...

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:32.450
Blackblack said they should 
be around here tonight.

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:34.720
How did she know that, anyway?

00:15:34.720 --> 00:15:35.930
Who knows?

00:15:35.930 --> 00:15:38.050
Anyway, let's find them.

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:46.880
You okay, Haru?

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:49.700
Sure you don't want me to 
hold back a little more?

00:15:49.700 --> 00:15:51.260
No, I'm fine.

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:54.520
If I can block your attacks,

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:56.970
I should be able to dodge Sonya's.

00:15:57.230 --> 00:16:00.060
Now, come on, one more time!

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:04.850
Ice Edge!

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:11.360
<i>I can't do anything else!</i>

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:15.280
<i>All I can do is not give up!</i>

00:16:17.060 --> 00:16:18.580
<i>That's all!</i>

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:25.520
Yeah, that's right.

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:26.760
I think so, too.

00:16:26.760 --> 00:16:29.960
Oh, Mi-kun, you know what I-chan's saying?

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:30.880
No, no idea.

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:35.590
But I know the three of us are 
all thinking the same thing.

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:49.020
Wiseman will defeat Sonya!

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:50.610
Oink...

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:53.650
Don't worry.

00:16:53.650 --> 00:16:56.230
Even when I'm queen of the world,

00:16:56.230 --> 00:16:59.330
I'll hire you to be my step stool.

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:02.980
Thank you so much, oink!

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:05.360
<i>Come back soon, Wiseman.</i>

00:17:06.030 --> 00:17:09.210
<i>With Haru-kun and his friends, 
and hopefully Erika-san.</i>

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:11.000
We're back!

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:11.630
They're here!

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:13.430
Wh-Who's there, oink?

00:17:13.430 --> 00:17:14.600
Wiseman!

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:21.100
Mizaru!

00:17:24.300 --> 00:17:25.440
Kikazaru!

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:31.160
Together, we are....

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:31.760
Wi!

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:32.350
Sema!

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:32.980
N!

00:17:34.290 --> 00:17:35.700
Wiseman!

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:40.810
How dare you guys do that without me, oink!

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:42.330
That's right!

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:43.440
Where're Haru-kun and his friends?

00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:45.280
Where's Erika-san?

00:17:45.280 --> 00:17:48.120
Sonya, we won't let you get away with this!

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:50.680
We'll defeat you!

00:17:52.230 --> 00:17:53.830
She says, "Are you ready?"

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:55.400
Fascinating.

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:59.140
You incompetents would try to fight me?

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:02.570
I'm afraid we can't run away anymore.

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:06.350
Even if we lose,

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:09.770
somebody will come to defeat you!

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:12.910
It doesn't matter who comes.
 I'll defeat them.

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:15.530
I'm the queen of this world,

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:17.240
Android Sonya!

00:18:33.580 --> 00:18:35.760
Why is this happening?

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:38.240
Why is this happening?

00:18:38.240 --> 00:18:41.390
Wiseman's our enemy! Why do they want help?

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:45.810
And who still uses a "robot takes 
over the world" plot these days?

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:48.560
Erika-san, it's an android, not a robot!

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:50.070
It doesn't matter!

00:18:50.070 --> 00:18:51.770
And Campanella's gone, too.

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:53.860
Where is she, anyway?

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:57.690
I think I know, but I won't say.

00:18:57.970 --> 00:18:59.780
Let's just hurry!

00:19:03.400 --> 00:19:05.660
<i>I don't sense Kikazaru and Iwazaru anywhere.</i>

00:19:06.180 --> 00:19:07.620
<i>Did she get them?</i>

00:19:08.770 --> 00:19:12.250
<i>I need to get at least 
one hit in one Sonya.</i>

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:14.280
There you are.

00:19:14.280 --> 00:19:16.290
You made this harder than it had to be.

00:19:16.290 --> 00:19:18.260
I'll finish this now.

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:20.740
<i>I'm sorry, Haru.</i>

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:24.220
<i>It seems this is all we can do.</i>

00:19:26.770 --> 00:19:27.310
Who's there?

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:33.480
It's disappointing to see that somebody 
like you also uses a whip.

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:36.360
You guys...

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:38.310
Are you okay, Mizaru?

00:19:38.310 --> 00:19:39.280
Sorry we're late.

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:42.600
Well, if it isn't Erika from Arc End.

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:44.740
You're in my database.

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:47.660
Along with your weaknesses 
and fighting habits.

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:50.550
That's an honor.

00:19:50.550 --> 00:19:51.910
Sonya-san...

00:19:52.490 --> 00:19:55.480
I love it when you slap me,

00:19:55.480 --> 00:19:58.670
but if you're going to take over the 
world and be mean to Sapphire-san,

00:19:59.190 --> 00:20:00.380
then you are my enemy.

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:03.170
She didn't say that.

00:20:03.170 --> 00:20:04.590
We'll fight you, Sonya.

00:20:04.940 --> 00:20:07.600
Even the weak are an 
annoyance in large numbers.

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:10.380
I guess I'll use a call 
to make this more fun.

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:11.460
Luluna!

00:20:12.780 --> 00:20:13.800
You're...

00:20:13.800 --> 00:20:14.630
Luluna...

00:20:14.630 --> 00:20:19.780
Now, Luluna, give me ten calls in a row!

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:24.240
For the androids that will be 
the new rulers of the world!

00:20:29.710 --> 00:20:30.370
What?

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:33.580
I like Wiseman.

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:37.710
Wiseman are fun to be with.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:41.090
They're cheerful, and energetic,

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:44.570
and it makes me happy to be with them.

00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:47.510
But more than that...

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:54.080
I don't like androids.

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:59.190
I see, so that's what this is about.

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:01.150
What do you mean?

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:04.360
Shut up, shut up, closed!

00:21:05.270 --> 00:21:08.280
The world must be open!

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:10.510
The android is superior!

00:21:10.510 --> 00:21:12.840
The android is best!

00:21:12.840 --> 00:21:14.370
Isn't that right, Guru?

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:15.790
Guru?

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:18.250
Guu-guru!

00:21:18.530 --> 00:21:20.140
Um...

00:21:20.140 --> 00:21:21.950
I'm having trouble following you,

00:21:21.950 --> 00:21:25.000
but can I just say, "No comment," guru?

00:21:25.660 --> 00:21:27.840
Now he's wimping out.

00:21:31.710 --> 00:21:32.640
Look!

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:33.980
Sonya's boobs!

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:36.180
What the hell's going on?

00:21:36.730 --> 00:21:37.560
They're expanding!

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:40.480
The world belongs to androids!

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:43.210
I will be the queen!

00:21:43.210 --> 00:21:48.610
Gingerbread! Lollipop! Marshmallow!

00:21:50.300 --> 00:21:52.330
So that's Sonya's true form?

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:55.370
Yeah. It's actually pretty cutting edge.

00:21:55.620 --> 00:21:57.000
Get her, Haru!

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:57.830
Okay!

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:04.530
I am the queen! The android queen!

00:22:04.530 --> 00:22:07.400
You won't beat me!

00:22:08.990 --> 00:22:13.120
Galaxy... Galaxy, which gives
 me inspiration...

00:22:13.120 --> 00:22:15.480
Is this destiny?

00:22:15.480 --> 00:22:18.440
Is this the destiny of the android?

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:21.400
Galaxy!

00:22:24.680 --> 00:22:25.860
Did we win?

00:22:27.630 --> 00:22:30.280
You can't bring those on airplanes.

00:22:31.750 --> 00:22:33.740
Whew...

00:22:34.060 --> 00:22:36.560
I was worried for a second there.

00:22:36.560 --> 00:22:39.830
Oh, I didn't know you were here, Campa—

00:22:39.830 --> 00:22:42.110
I don't know what you're talking about!

00:22:42.110 --> 00:22:44.820
Mi-kun, I'm so glad you're safe!

00:22:44.820 --> 00:22:45.900
Yeah! Yeah!

00:22:45.900 --> 00:22:47.460
Yeah, you guys, too.

00:22:47.460 --> 00:22:50.380
I'm so glad it worked out.

00:22:50.380 --> 00:22:54.410
From now on it's business as 
usual for the four of us, huh?

00:23:01.020 --> 00:23:05.070
I'm telling you, we're taking 
this village's quest!

00:23:05.360 --> 00:23:06.800
What?

00:23:06.800 --> 00:23:09.940
We're the ones who got the 
job offer to begin with!

00:23:11.220 --> 00:23:13.560
Can't we all do it together?

00:23:13.560 --> 00:23:16.080
We can't!

00:23:16.080 --> 00:23:17.100
Sorry.

00:23:17.100 --> 00:23:19.420
We'll take it by force, then!

00:23:19.420 --> 00:23:21.580
Lulululu, get a call ready!

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:23.420
Sure.

00:23:23.420 --> 00:23:26.130
Stop relying on calls!

00:23:26.130 --> 00:23:27.510
That's just you being selfish!

00:23:27.510 --> 00:23:29.010
It is not!

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:32.060
This is how it should be.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Episode 10
The Happy Elements Episode</b>

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:38.100
"The Happy Elements Episode."
